    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-install-context",
        "moduleId": "prepare-environment",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材前提：先激活虚拟环境",
        "markdown": "教材指出：安装 Flask 的前提是已经**激活虚拟环境**。激活后执行安装命令，会把 Flask 以及相关的一些依赖包安装到对应的虚拟环境中，而不是装进系统的全局 Python。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000009"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 1 章：准备工作",
                "安装 Flask"
              ],
              "lineStart": 67,
              "lineEnd": 70,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "89b6f0230eb477c0403fc6d81094e40983b638b65bbc558659fab772703e4fd8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-venv",
        "moduleId": "prepare-environment",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "model｜为什么必须装进虚拟环境",
        "markdown": "把虚拟环境想成一个独立的工具箱：每个项目只看到自己工具箱里的 Flask。若不激活就安装，包可能落到全局解释器或其他项目环境里，多个项目之间就会互相干扰。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-activation-check",
        "moduleId": "prepare-environment",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "model｜怎样确认已激活",
        "markdown": "激活成功的标志通常是命令提示符前出现虚拟环境名称（例如 `(env)`）。也可以运行 `pip --version`，观察它报告的 Python 路径是否指向当前项目目录下的虚拟环境；确认后再继续安装。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-context",
            "model-why-venv"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-install-command",
        "moduleId": "install-flask",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "model｜安装命令",
        "markdown": "在已激活的环境中执行：\n```bash\npip install flask\n```\nWindows 与 macOS/Linux 在激活后使用同一条命令即可。这里不要加 `sudo`，否则可能把包装到系统目录而不是项目环境。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-context",
            "model-activation-check"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-install-output",
        "moduleId": "install-flask",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "model｜读懂安装输出",
        "markdown": "安装时 pip 会下载 Flask 的 wheel 包并解析依赖，结束时打印 `Successfully installed ...`。输出里通常不止一个包名，因为除 Flask 本身外还会装入它运行所需的依赖包（如 Werkzeug、Jinja2 等）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-install-command"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-verify-commands",
        "moduleId": "verify-result",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "model｜两种验证方式",
        "markdown": "安装结束后做两项检查：\n```bash\npip show flask\npython -c \"import flask; print(flask.__version__)\"\n```\n第一条确认当前环境的 pip 记录了 Flask；第二条确认当前 Python 解释器能真正导入它，并打印版本号。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-install-command",
            "model-install-output"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-verify-location",
        "moduleId": "verify-result",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "model｜版本与安装位置",
        "markdown": "`pip show flask` 输出中的 `Version` 是实际安装的版本，`Location` 则是包的安装目录。若 `Location` 指向全局 site-packages 而不是当前虚拟环境，说明命令装到了错误的环境，需要回到已激活的环境重新安装。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-verify-commands"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-common-errors",
        "moduleId": "recover-errors",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "model｜常见报错与修复",
        "markdown": "常见症状与对应排查：\n- `pip: command not found` 或“不是内部或外部命令”：虚拟环境未激活，先激活再安装。\n- `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'flask'`：安装和运行用的不是同一个解释器，检查 `python` 是否来自当前环境。\n- 下载超时或连接失败：属于网络或软件源问题，可换用可访问的 PyPI 镜像后重试。\n- 权限错误：说明正在写入无权限的系统目录，应回到虚拟环境中安装。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-install-command",
            "model-verify-commands"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "install-checklist",
        "moduleId": "wrap-up",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "model｜安装完成检查表",
        "markdown": "逐条自检：\n1. 命令提示符显示虚拟环境名称。\n2. `pip install flask` 以 `Successfully installed` 结束。\n3. `pip show flask` 的 `Location` 位于当前环境。\n4. `python -c \"import flask\"` 不报错。\n全部满足后，环境准备就完整了，本章小结会把这些步骤串成一条可复用的准备流程。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-verify-location",
            "model-common-errors"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
